d when color prop is set"],[528,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[524,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[526,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[527,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[529,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1095,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[222,"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"],[262,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[773,"`Enter/Space`"],[305,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[439,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[271,"`Escape`"],[693,"`Escape`"],[775,"`Escape`"],[1344,"`Escape`"],[398,"`FieldGroup` is purely presentational — it renders the styled `Group` and holds no React Aria context. The surrounding field wires value, disabled, and validation state into its controls."],[399,"`FieldGroup` rounds its outer corners from DOM order: the group's CSS rounds the start corners of its **first child** and the end corners of its **last child**, so controls are seamless inside and rounded only at the box edges. Author children in visual order and the rounding follows — no per-control positioning prop. A lone control (a TextField input, a Select trigger) is both first and last, so it rounds both edges. The rules are RTL-safe (they use logical `start`/`end` corners)."],[395,"`FieldLabel`, `FieldDescription`, and `FieldError` each render `null` when they have no content, so callers pass `label` / `description` / `errorMessage` straight through without guarding."],[368,"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."],[1658,"`Flex` is a one-dimensional layout component for arranging children in rows or columns with alignment and spacing control. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[533,"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"],[235,"`formatOptions` accepts any `Intl.DateTimeFormatOptions` (e.g. `{ dateStyle: 'short' }`, `{ month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }`). `placeholder` sets the empty-state text."],[1616,"`Grid` is a two-dimensional CSS Grid layout component for complex grid-based layouts. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[1235,"`Heading` renders a semantic `h1`-`h6` element via the `level` prop (default `2`).\nInside a `Modal`/`Dialog`, add `slot=\"title\"` and it labels the dialog automatically."],[136,"`horizontal`: Arranges checkboxes in a horizontal row"],[427,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the accordion pattern — a thin wrapper over RAC `DisclosurePanel` that hides when collapsed. The trigger is any component you slot in with `slot=\"trigger\"` — there's no dedicated trigger component."],[1532,"`legendPosition` puts the legend above or below the plot, or hides it with `null`. Multi-series charts get a bottom legend by default."],[1586,"`lg` - Large spacing"],[590,"`ListBox` requires either `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. For a labeled, popover-style picker, prefer `Select`."],[1585,"`md` - Medium spacing"],[625,"`MenuTrigger` exposes its open state via `isOpen`/`onOpenChange`,\nwhich can be used to drive the rotation of a chevron icon."],[225,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[334,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-da